{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_title", "source_sha256": "fe90f67997a77594fb8ddb4b8fd79d2e8ac1f4e98a16710c420e68b03d89deec", "ja": "一緒に、笑って", "zh": "一同欢笑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c432a44f8cb48571b885f1b8f5e7dc9b7be98da8c27bc1207703273587a230ca", "ja": "海美の新曲が教育番組の体操コーナーで\n使われる事に。参加を渋る男の子から理由を\n聞いた海美は悩むが、「運動が嫌な思い出の\nまま終わっててほしくない」という自分の\n気持ちに気づき、解決方法を考える。", "zh": "海美的新曲被教育节目的体操环节\n选用了。海美向不愿参加的小男孩\n询问了原因后十分烦恼，但她察觉到了\n自己“不希望运动只留下讨厌的回忆”\n的心情，并开始思考解决办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1000_p", "source_sha256": "87d8ab8e0db2cc0b209cef0dc511b7ef39cd59c93f0d1f2ead58858fb9930741", "ja": "（教育番組の収録が終わった。楽しかったのか、\nアイドルのみんなも子ども達も、笑顔でいっぱいだ）", "zh": "（教育节目的录制结束了。不知道是不是玩得很开心，偶像们和孩子们脸上都洋溢着笑容。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "ae4681afcbc8478b6f974ae2d23d08ef26140d0f5943ace8ef6eff383a2039d6", "ja": "みんな、たくさん腕を振れた～！？\n前腕二頭筋が、だいぶ鍛えられたよ！", "zh": "大家都挥了好多次手臂吧～！？\n肱二头肌也锻炼得相当充分了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "be3bc33ae9098c469dff23af7e8a41aa0f01e3f5f524f5fea07da82b7af63956", "ja": "キミも、一緒に体操してくれてありがとうね！\n足は大丈夫？　無理してない？", "zh": "你也一起来做操，谢谢你啦！\n腿还好吗？没有勉强自己吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1003_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "91fae41d1aa02a3489764cb8555ea0845dd9d9525f9f4547b4d190dd86ff97d4", "ja": "だいじょうぶです。", "zh": "没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1004_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "dd22a3e05ea5d9cabd925bc07fb4aa4e204db3ca64239113efa27e1a2342d4bb", "ja": "なんか……うたを聞いてたら、\nからだがかってにうごいて……。", "zh": "不知怎么的……听着歌，身体就不由自主地动起来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1005_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "9be3072db3d46456cfe04fdb0660269e4b0011d905fdaf3ae5779be991addf7f", "ja": "こんなのはじめてだったけど……\n楽しかったです。", "zh": "虽然是第一次经历这种事……  \n但很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "eddc50c9c2855339f5d3a2971b21774158e17dbce74507744b47be8d66068528", "ja": "ほんとー！？\n一番うれしい感想だよ！", "zh": "真的——！？\n这是最让我开心的评价了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1007_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "b5d8dab4c1e56d30e86a5b26d625a2b037390768db0b94a3c7d460756f2f15b2", "ja": "うれしい、ですか……？", "zh": "感到高兴……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "a248f2f09efe0c38fb8de226b181b7fd97695dd4ab234ea661e43254325a9944", "ja": "うん！　苦手だなーっていう気持ちが、\n『美ルドアップ体操』で楽しいに変わったんでしょ？", "zh": "嗯！把原本觉得不擅长的心情，通过『美尔杜升级体操』变成了开心，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "91f21b6ed9862b18bb06b6dcc658440151d6d675f6aed7d9a541f0c5d954c477", "ja": "そんなの、うれしいに決まってるよ！\nすっごく、すっごくうれしいよーっ！", "zh": "那当然开心啦！\n超级、超级开心的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1010_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "658e1608c53b57331aa38dd86a86a7603905495128cb82ee0e7ad58263691f1c", "ja": "……。\nあの、おねえさん……。", "zh": "……。\n那个，大姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "faee03c61dfb9168ff55da30ce75500746c5dd7a483e7b6ca362e8b8aeabee8c", "ja": "あっ、そういえば名前言ってなかったっけ？\n私は海美！　高坂海美だよ、よろしくね！", "zh": "啊，对了，我还没说过名字吧？\n我是海美！高坂海美，请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1012_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "2394dabee689b3ee88bb62f5bd1d6b95d84b8f880eb4a8320f112e354c6ef7fa", "ja": "うみさん……。", "zh": "海美小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "9e6f6678ace015f71dbdb95b43b18a12d27eddf076f2634260e0d12ccb27441d", "ja": "お？　あの子、なんか、もじもじしてるね？\nこの流れは、もしかして……！", "zh": "哦？那孩子好像有点扭扭捏捏的？\n照这个情况，该不会是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "e323cc967de70d23fafdd4eb08646ecad2271ea83ba50888383933a596514a06", "ja": "う、うん。それに、ちょっと赤くなってる……\n体操した後だから……じゃないよね……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯。而且，脸还有点红……\n应该不是……因为做过体操的关系吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "aacd0f00512a4ca6e2093b8e8d554e2820475407bcf442ec186df78824e82e13", "ja": "……最近の子ってませてるなぁ。\nでも、海美さんは絶対に気付いてないよね。", "zh": "……现在的孩子还真是早熟啊。\n不过，海美姐绝对没注意到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "9d672dde638e06be9ae0e9aa74283741519c0dd4c911c2227b65ee67a62f48f8", "ja": "も、もしかして、これが噂の……？\nドキドキするね……！", "zh": "难、难道说，这就是传闻中的……？\n好紧张啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1017_p", "source_sha256": "70415f179531e3bdf23be3c152cf4e2eb32a3418bfb75940f7c8d8c706aeb9f7", "ja": "こらこら。\n人の話に聞き耳を立てるんじゃない。", "zh": "喂喂。\n别偷听别人说话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1018_p", "source_sha256": "57b9da18c9ad627d515acf0ec33a09dc64d419ea7293dce4536b87876ab4bec1", "ja": "（と言いつつ、俺も気にはしているけど……。\nあの子、一体海美に何を言うつもりなのかな）", "zh": "（嘴上这么说，其实我也很在意……那孩子到底打算对海美说什么呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1019_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "cd9aefa4aa431fa97191aa9b3217d2f01278ceb5abd0be0a0b1ccb8fd2d0327a", "ja": "ずっと、思ってたんですけど。\nうみさんて……その……。", "zh": "我一直都在想来着。  \n海美……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "f716a35350102b88ad1f8af20de5a091528c4bc5123e804a8872b9db072cc6e6", "ja": "うん、なになにー？", "zh": "嗯，怎么啦——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1021_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "07fc72c9cbb7aac6730cfc18f6a186539816f2b1209336825c97bb3adca5a2fb", "ja": "うみさんて、\n変わったおねえさんですね……。", "zh": "海美小姐真是个奇怪的大姐姐呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "89b7dd14f55249669afc0ae7ffde87b45e8be240e578d040d3be592bab010db4", "ja": "えーーーーっ！！？　か、変わったお姉さん！？\n素敵とかじゃなくて！？", "zh": "诶————！！？　奇、奇怪的大姐姐！？  \n不是该说很棒之类的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1023_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "271196cbd40ad7f0921148252d58b7c5a413eea4f89f2e4822af4c46d2e85e03", "ja": "はい。あ、ダンスはすごく、じょうずでした。\nあと、ずっと笑ってて……だから……。", "zh": "是的。啊，舞跳得特别好。还有，一直都在笑……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1024_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "74d3bf9d8732a5e9cc547154e657c1d1facb8ecd21f69217d9189d9813f139ec", "ja": "あの、げんきがもらえたきがします。\nありがとうございました。", "zh": "那个，感觉自己获得了元气。\n非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "080fe902978d30d48f90e1f5170e492ebdd189d76a73850b7f22d9166181740f", "ja": "え、えへへ……♪　うん、笑顔って元気になるよね！\n私も楽しかったよ、ありがとう！", "zh": "呃、嘿嘿……♪嗯，笑容真的能让人打起精神呢！  \n我也很开心，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "f3f4a54dd993563d7692b98c5544a47719db53c8b873b47193a96c0d630b7a7d", "ja": "微笑ましいオチでしたな～。\nまあ、うみみんらしいというか……。", "zh": "真是个让人会心一笑的收尾呢～\n嘛，或者说挺有海美美风格的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "1de060a4050dad356b1ed2461f1c324e4f12f1abd5216596a957fce4fd22fef3", "ja": "海美さんらしい……うん、桃子もそう思う。\n今日の収録もね。", "zh": "很有海美风格……嗯，桃子也这么觉得。\n今天的录音也是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "688f47b60b3710c59bf8e7e470f78fb3cdf35a5fc290feca093b2f943b3c2236", "ja": "そうね。スタジオ中に、\n笑顔と元気がいっぱいに溢れてたし。", "zh": "是啊。整个摄影棚里，都洋溢着满满的笑容与活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a978cd4df01db1b2a11462d7d7cc7c35406a1394b1be53b6a26ba08c34fb5ab6", "ja": "ああ、海美らしい番組になったんじゃないか。\nきっといろんな人に、魅力が伝わるはずだ。", "zh": "嗯，确实做成了充满海美风格的节目。\n一定能让很多人感受到她的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "74d27c719e37d757d2b14c4852959339bea3af66554c38868ec7d75b2a8d9bb9", "ja": "海美ちゃん、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "海美，真的辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "025c0cbf9c24fa06db9b2233dfadcb94561b2c4a51fa4dfab70d522aa0a4f4ed", "ja": "みんな、ありがとー！　よーし！　これからも\n『美ルドアップ体操』、広めるぞーっ！", "zh": "大家，谢谢啦——！好！今后也要把《美丽升级体操》推广开去——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1032_p", "source_sha256": "acafc23eb661db611f6d066f66f79f5c2dd80167425a1beb72d8ea4d00c4b60d", "ja": "（できない事ができるようになる。それが\nすごい事なのは、アイドルの皆もよく知っている）", "zh": "（原本做不到的事变得能够做到。这有多么了不起，偶像们也都很清楚）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_157_1033_p", "source_sha256": "4ca02789fcec083a54bb883ad2f26271233276aa239d03c7d9b22db4e11283f8", "ja": "（本人は無自覚だろうけど……海美はあの男の子の\n未来を、ほんの少し変えたのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（她自己可能都没有察觉……但海美或许已经稍微改变了那个男孩的未来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
